{'symbol': 'CB', 'date': '2022-11-17 11:30:00', 'title': 'CHUBB LIMITED BOARD DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': "ZURICH , NOV. 17, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF CHUBB LIMITED (NYSE: CB) TODAY DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND EQUAL TO $0.83 PER SHARE, PAYABLE ON JANUARY 6, 2023 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON DECEMBER 16, 2022.\xa0 THE DIVIDEND WILL BE PAYABLE OUT OF LEGAL RESERVES AND WILL BE MADE IN UNITED STATES DOLLARS BY THE COMPANY'S TRANSFER AGENT, AS DESCRIBED IN THE CHUBB LIMITED 2022 PROXY STATEMENT."}